title: LSP Go to Definition - (Example)

Open this tiddler's `.tid` file in your editor and ctrl-click each target below.

These open `LSP/LSP Server.tid`:

* [[LSP Server]]
* {{LSP Server!!title}}, a transclusion of one field
* <$link to="LSP Server">a link widget</$link>

These open nothing:

* [[$:/core/ui/PageTemplate]], a shadow tiddler, which has no file of its own
* [[No Such Tiddler]], which does not exist
* LSP Server, merely mentioned, which is no link at all

